  << /ActualText (Reward Exploration Without Punishing Those Who Don\031t\nOptional routes offer meaningful rewards\054 a silenced weapon\054 a sniper rifle\054 or tactical intel from security monitors\056 Explorers gain advantages\054 but players who push forward still progress\056 Curiosity is rewarded\054 never required\056)
