2008 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Build a Clear Escalation Curve\nThe level progresses from movement and exploration in Beat 1\054 to early combat in Beat 2\054 and finally to full tactical encounters by Beat 6\056 Each beat introduces a new layer of complexity while reinforcing what the player has already learned\056)
     /K [ 34 ]
